  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ff7e1a551b864e4d94b235e1b05b001, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_introduct_14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  type: 0
  description: 
  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "Th\u1EDDi gian tr\xF4i \u0111i, ta kh\xF4ng c\xF2n l\xE0 \u0111\u1EE9a tr\u1EBB
      ch\u01A1i tr\xF2 c\u1EDD lau n\u1EEFa. M\u1EA3nh \u0111\u1EA5t Hoa L\u01B0
      \u2013 qu\xEA h\u01B0\u01A1ng ta \u2013 hi\u1EC3m tr\u1EDF m\xE0 c\u0169ng
      kh\u1EAFc nghi\u1EC7t."
    - "N\xFAi \u0111\xE1 d\u1EF1ng th\xE0nh v\xE1ch, s\xF4ng ng\xF2i ch\u1EB1ng ch\u1ECBt,
      ru\u1ED9ng b\u1EADc thang n\u1ED1i ti\u1EBFp nhau gi\u1EEFa thung l\u0169ng."
    - "M\u1ED9t v\xF9ng \u0111\u1EA5t kh\xF3 v\xE0o, kh\xF3 ra\u2026 v\xE0 n\u1EBFu
      bi\u1EBFt t\u1EADn d\u1EE5ng, n\xF3 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 tr\u1EDF th\xE0nh c\u0103n
      c\u1EE9 b\u1EA5t kh\u1EA3 x\xE2m ph\u1EA1m."
    - "Tri\u1EC1u Ng\xF4 th\xEC ng\xE0y c\xE0ng suy y\u1EBFu. C\xE1c h\xE0o tr\u01B0\u1EDFng
      n\u1ED5i lo\u1EA1n, gi\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EDD \u1EDF kh\u1EAFp n\u01A1i. Ta
      hi\u1EC3u: n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB, th\xEC khi gi\xF4ng b\xE3o
      ch\xEDnh tr\u1ECB \u1EADp \u0111\u1EBFn, Hoa L\u01B0 s\u1EBD ch\u1EC9 l\xE0
      m\u1ED9t th\xF4n x\xF3m nh\u1ECF b\u1ECB cu\u1ED1n \u0111i. "
    - "Ta ph\u1EA3i bi\u1EBFn n\u01A1i \u0111\xE2y th\xE0nh th\xE0nh tr\xEC, bi\u1EBFn
      d\xE2n l\xE0ng th\xE0nh qu\xE2n, bi\u1EBFn n\xFAi r\u1EEBng th\xE0nh th\xE0nh
      qu\xE1ch."
    images:
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
    - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ba370862297078040bbce71838be441a, type: 3}
